        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1 He daic liangmeipu, Kaipouc Ravguangc thuanc e,",
            "Damcloumeipu ringhmei Kaipouc kiu Nang e;",
            "’Suanmei, paapc phunghmei, ryanramei Duangda e;",
            "Ryanra ryanriumei guay (3) ’khaengvloumei Nang e.",
            "",
            "2 Neymei guay tiiloumeipu Kaipouc Nang e,",
            "Nang bangc aniw #^5 neymei guay tiilou e,",
            "Nang bangc nunc kapmei, kalanghmei chulou e,",
            "Kachangcmei lev gaymei (3) kachangcmei Nang e.",
            "",
            "3 Nthiamhmei, daihmei guay lung tiilaiclou o,",
            "Meic guay khou lev Nang ta zauczihmei guay khou,",
            "’Taw hei kaniw #^5 guloumei laa diu khang,",
            "“Akumh ni cho?” twna (3) phu kan diu. Amen!",
            "",
            "4 Zinghpui bamv ’patloumei guay dwan gay kan diu!",
            "Daic liangmei Racguangc, Nang hym daihmei sw diu!",
            "Kandih khou dwan gaymei dam laatowmei guay,",
            "“Hosanna! Hosanna!” (3) Kaucna thuanc bam diu!",
            "",
            "5 Meic guay #^5 Nang ta chakhwang champouh sw diu!",
            "Nang guangcdic 5#^ hymdaihmei guangcdic sw diu!",
            "Tingkauhmei nunc #^5 taanhmei kumc kandih khou",
            "Nang ningmei 5#^ taanc diu, (3) kabamv kathuic khou!"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
